[For "black"]
[Kind "sideline"]
[Start "caro-two-knights 5...e6"]
[Name "Two Knights: 6.exd5"]

6. exd5 cxd5 { Takes back with the pawn: the c-file is half open, and the knight on c6 has a natural square. }
7. Bb5+ Nc6 { Blocks with a developing move. }
8. O-O Nf6 { Develops. Black has the solid structure of the Exchange, and the bishop on b5 is doing little. } *
